/*
 * Declares the TupleType class.
 *
 * This module defines the native tuple type used by the Ymir semantic
 * generator. A TupleType represents a fixed-size, ordered collection of
 * heterogeneous values. Each element has its own static type, and tuples
 * preserve both order and arity. Tuples are value types: they store their
 * elements directly and participate in mutability, compatibility, and borrowing
 * rules according to their components.
 * 
 * <hr>
 * 
 * @Package: ymirc        
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::generator::type::native::compound::tuple
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/generator/type/native/compound/tuple.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created (YYYY-MM-DD): 2021-11-20
